## Title: Wide Quest Log Plus
## Notes: Wide, dual-pane quest log with quest levels, dungeon, raid and elite tags, and quest IDs. See your whole quest list and every quest's details at once, sorted your way. A bigger quest log that keeps the Blizzard look.
